      "China's aggression against India is presented as having destroyed the moral and political basis of that solidarity.",
      "The essay warns that negotiating on China's terms could make India a satellite of China.",
      "Rajagopalachari supports Western assistance against communist China while also calling for eventual peace and neighbourliness."
